	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.copy.header": "使用打印机",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.copy.text_1": "复印附魔书需要液态经验。",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.copy.text_2": "如果附魔书上的附魔等级超过了该附魔的最高等级，则需要液态超级经验。",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.copy.text_3": "复印成书需要墨水。",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.copy.text_4": "命名牌和列车时刻表同样可以复印。",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.copy.text_5": "将命名牌设为打印目标后，打印机还能为物品命名。",

	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.crushing_wheel_tweak.header": "这叫做低效……",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.crushing_wheel_tweak.text_1": "粉碎轮击杀生物时，有概率掉落少量经验颗粒。",

	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.disenchant.header": "祛魔",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.disenchant.text_1": "放入的物品会被祛除附魔，移除的附魔将折算为液态经验存入储罐。",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.disenchant.text_2": "站在祛魔池上方的玩家会被迅速吸取经验等级，吸取的经验将转化为液态经验存入储罐。",

	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.drop_experience_nugget.header": "……这算经验农场吗？",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.drop_experience_nugget.text_1": "机械手击杀生物时会掉落经验颗粒。",

	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.enchant.header": "附魔",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.enchant.text_1": "烈焰人附魔室能为你的物品附魔。",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.enchant.text_2": "不过，它无法给书本附魔……",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.enchant.text_3": "……也无法为物品附上与已有附魔冲突的附魔。",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.enchant.text_4": "条件允许时，烈焰人附魔室可以将已有附魔提升至更高等级。",

	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience_bottle.header": "处理附魔之瓶",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience_bottle.text_1": "附魔之瓶可以在分液池中被排空。",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience_bottle.text_2": "也可以通过注液器来制造附魔之瓶。",

	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.hyper_enchant.header": "超越附魔",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.hyper_enchant.text_1": "这是一罐液态超级经验。",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.hyper_enchant.text_2": "超级经验能让烈焰人附魔室进入超级燃烧状态，该状态下附魔产出的等级比设定等级高一级。",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.hyper_enchant.text_3": "最高等级为 1 级的附魔无法通过超越附魔提升至 2 级。",

	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.leak.header": "噢不！漏了！",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.leak.text_1": "我有一罐满满的经验",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.leak.text_2": "我有一根开放式管道",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.leak.text_3": "嗯！",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.leak.text_4": "别担心，泄漏的液态经验会变成经验球。玩家也可以站在管道口直接吸收经验。",

	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.transform.header": "使用附魔指南",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.transform.text_1": "手持附魔指南，潜行右键烈焰人燃烧室，即可将其转化为烈焰人附魔室。",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.transform.text_2": "使用前需先配置附魔指南。右键附魔指南或右键烈焰人附魔室均可打开配置面板。",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.transform.text_3": "如需取回附魔指南，手持扳手潜行右键烈焰人附魔室即可。",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.transform.text_4": "你也可以手持新的附魔指南直接右键烈焰人附魔室来替换。",

	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.automate.header": "使用动力臂自动化",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.automate.text_1": "烈焰人附魔室能用动力臂进行自动化",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.automate.text_2": "动力臂能插入需要附魔的道具",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.automate.text_3": "动力臂也能喂经验燃料",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.automate.text_4": "动力臂能取出已附魔物品和无效物品",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.intro.header": "认识烈焰人附魔室",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.intro.text_1": "这是一个烈焰人附魔室，它的功能类似于附魔台",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.intro.text_2": "通入液态经验让其开始工作",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.intro.text_3": "开始用它附魔之前，必须通过面板设置附魔等级。原版附魔台的等级上限为30级",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.intro.text_4": "面板也是过滤槽位。手持物品右键槽位将其设置为模板物品。该状态被称为模板附魔模式",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.intro.text_5": "在模板附魔模式下，烈焰人附魔室能对附魔模板进行附魔",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.intro.text_6": "模板附魔模式用于产出模板物品支持的附魔",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.intro.text_7": "比如，将钻石胸甲置于过滤槽位，会导致仅出现钻石胸甲附魔",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.intro.text_8": "给烈焰人附魔室一张空白附魔模板，先前提到的附魔将被附魔到模板上",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.intro.text_9": "不同的材料和模板物品类别均会产出不同附魔",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.intro.text_10": "这是因为金胸甲比钻石胸甲附魔能力（可附魔性）更好，所以会产生相对更好的附魔",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.intro.text_11": "然而，附魔等级并不是越高越好，有些附魔会因为等级过高而不再出现！",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.super_enchant.header": "使用烈焰人附魔室进行超越附魔",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.super_enchant.text_1": "烈焰人附魔室有两个\"胃\"。喂它一个附魔蛋糕……",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.super_enchant.text_2": "……它会开始超级燃烧。该状态便是超越附魔模式",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.super_enchant.text_3": "烈焰人附魔室的第二个液体舱不能用管道直接通入液态经验。必须使用合适的超经验物品，例如附魔蛋糕",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.super_enchant.text_4": "处于超越附魔模式时，附魔等级上限会极大提升。此外，该附魔室能出产宝藏附魔",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.super_enchant.text_5": "超越附魔模式下的烈焰人附魔室专门处理超越附魔模板",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.super_enchant.text_6": "确保附近放置好了避雷针",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.super_enchant.text_7": "超越附魔会招致雷击",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.super_enchant.text_8": "你可以在烈焰人附魔室正上方放置方块来躲避雷击，但诅咒附魔将会出现",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_enchanter.super_enchant.text_9": "如果没有避雷针……",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_forger.automate.header": "使用动力臂自动化",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_forger.automate.text_1": "烈焰人锻造室能用动力臂进行自动化",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_forger.automate.text_2": "动力臂能插入需要锻造的道具",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_forger.automate.text_3": "动力臂也能喂经验燃料",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_forger.automate.text_4": "动力臂能取出已锻造物品",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_forger.intro.header": "认识烈焰人锻造室",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_forger.intro.text_1": "这是一个烈焰人锻造室，它的功能类似于铁砧",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_forger.intro.text_2": "通入液态经验让其开始工作",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_forger.intro.text_3": "烈焰人锻造室能够合并同种物品的附魔，就像在铁砧上那样，并且不再有\"累积惩罚\"",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_forger.intro.text_4": "烈焰人锻造室还能合并附魔模板",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_forger.intro.text_5": "最重要的是，烈焰人锻造室能够将附魔模板应用到物品上！",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_forger.intro.text_6": "而且，烈焰人锻造室还能将装备、附魔书和附魔模板上的附魔剥离到空白的附魔模板上",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_forger.super_enchant.header": "使用烈焰人锻造室进行超越附魔",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_forger.super_enchant.text_1": "烈焰人锻造室有两个\"胃\"。喂它一个附魔蛋糕……",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_forger.super_enchant.text_2": "……它会开始超级燃烧。该状态便是超越附魔模式",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_forger.super_enchant.text_3": "烈焰人锻造室的第二个液体舱不能用管道直接通入液态经验。必须使用合适的超经验物品，例如附魔蛋糕",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_forger.super_enchant.text_4": "处于超越附魔模式时，该锻造室能通过合并相同附魔来突破原版附魔等级上限。冲突附魔也能被合并在一起",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_forger.super_enchant.text_5": "超越附魔模式下的烈焰人锻造室专门处理和应用超越附魔模板",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_forger.super_enchant.text_6": "确保附近放置好了避雷针",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_forger.super_enchant.text_7": "超越附魔会招致雷击",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_forger.super_enchant.text_8": "你可以在烈焰人锻造室正上方放置方块来躲避雷击，但\"累积惩罚\"将会出现",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.blaze_forger.super_enchant.text_9": "如果没有避雷针……",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.advance.header": "你也许会感兴趣的事",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.advance.text_1": "在准备和附魔打交道之前，你需要了解这么几件事",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.advance.text_2": "经验块不再是纯粹的装饰性和存储型方块，你之后会需要用到它",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.advance.text_3": "制造附魔模板和超越经验块都需要用到经验块",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.advance.text_4": "这是超越经验块，制作超越附魔模板需要它",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.advance.text_5": "烈焰人附魔室",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.advance.text_6": "烈焰人锻造室",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.advance.text_7": "这些是超级燃烧状态的烈焰人，代表着它们处于超越附魔模式",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.advance.text_8": "超越附魔能让你超越极限！",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.advance.text_9": "超越附魔具体包括突破附魔等级上限，合并冲突附魔，直接获取宝藏附魔",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.beacon_base_block.header": "作为信标基底",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.intro.header": "了解如何处理和运用经验",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.intro.text_1": "这是一罐液态经验，它将会是经验在加工过程中最常见的形态",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.intro.text_2": "将你携带的经验转化为流体形式，需要这两个元件",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.intro.text_3": "流体舱口可以直接存取物品中的经验",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.intro.text_4": "经验舱口可以直接存取玩家携带的经验",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.intro.text_5": "自动化是机械动力不可或缺的一部分，对吧？",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.intro.text_6": "你可以使用分液池来将物品中的液态经验倒出",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.intro.text_7": "动力砂轮也能粉碎物品，它能将经验颗粒转换为液态经验",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.intro.text_8": "粉碎轮现在有了新机制：被粉碎轮碾死的生物有小概率掉落经验颗粒",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.intro.text_9": "与之相似的是，机械手在杀死生物后会产出经验颗粒",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.intro.text_10": "如果你需要将液态经验装回容器物品中，可以使用注液器",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.intro.text_11": "从管道泄露的液态经验将转变为经验球",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.prepare_for_super_enchant.header": "准备超越附魔的材料",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.prepare_for_super_enchant.text_1": "第一种材料是超越经验块，它能被加工成超越附魔模板。这需要经验块",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.prepare_for_super_enchant.text_2": "而且你应该还会用到避雷针",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.prepare_for_super_enchant.text_3": "雷击！",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.prepare_for_super_enchant.text_4": "绝大部分雷击只有一定概率转化经验块，只有超越附魔带来的雷击保证转化必然发生",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.prepare_for_super_enchant.text_5": "第二种材料是附魔蛋糕，它有着\"超经验\"的作用，用于支持烈焰人的超级燃烧模式",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.prepare_for_super_enchant.text_6": "如果附魔蛋糕用于让烈焰人进入超越附魔模式，那超越经验块到底是用来干嘛的？",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.prepare_for_super_enchant.text_7": "答案是用来制造第三种材料：超越附魔模板",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience.prepare_for_super_enchant.text_8": "在超越附魔模式下，烈焰人会拒绝接受任何普通附魔模板，必须使用超越附魔模板",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience_hatch.intro.header": "认识经验舱口",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience_hatch.intro.text_1": "使用方式非常简单。右键舱口存储经验……",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience_hatch.intro.text_2": "……蹲下右键舱口取出经验",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience_hatch.intro.text_3": "舱口侧面有一个过滤插槽和仪表盘。通过仪表盘，你可以设置每次存取经验的上限",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience_hatch.intro.text_4": "过滤插槽则用来处理其他模组的经验流体",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience_hatch.intro.text_5": "比如，假设液态青色染料是来自其他模组的经验流体",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience_hatch.intro.text_6": "将液态染料桶置于过滤槽位",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience_hatch.intro.text_7": "你现在能直接将液态青色染料作为\"青色经验\"进行存取了",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience_lantern.intro.header": "认识经验灯笼",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience_lantern.intro.text_1": "经验灯笼能够吸附近玩家和经验球的经验。它会根据内部存储的经验总量发光",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.experience_lantern.intro.text_2": "经验灯笼在动态结构上仍可工作",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.mechanical_grindstone.extra.header": "用动力砂轮进行砂磨",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.mechanical_grindstone.extra.text_1": "动力砂轮不仅有砂轮的全部功能……",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.mechanical_grindstone.extra.text_2": "……而且还有砂纸的功能",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.mechanical_grindstone.extra.text_3": "可以直接手持物品使用动力砂轮",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.mechanical_grindstone.intro.header": "认识动力砂轮",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.mechanical_grindstone.intro.text_1": "手持动力砂轮右键分液池……",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.mechanical_grindstone.intro.text_2": "这是一个砂轮分液池。将另一个动力砂轮置于其上来使用它",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.mechanical_grindstone.intro.text_3": "物品形式的经验会被动力砂轮粉碎为液体形式",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.printer.intro.header": "认识打印机",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.printer.intro.text_1": "这是一台打印机",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.printer.intro.text_2": "在使用前，通过过滤槽位设置想打印的物品……",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.printer.intro.text_3": "……并且通入对应的液体",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.printer.intro.text_4": "复印成书",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.printer.intro.text_5": "改变包裹外观",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.printer.intro.text_6": "复制附魔书",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.printer.intro.text_7": "它还能为物品命名，复印列车时刻表，复制剪贴板，改变包裹地址等。你可以使用 JEI 模组查询打印配方",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.tag.experience_appliances": "经验相关",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.tag.experience_appliances.description": "处理和使用经验会用到的元件",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.tag.super_experience_related": "超越经验相关",
	"create_enchantment_industry.ponder.tag.super_experience_related.description": "超越附魔会用到的元件",


